ource.json`  \n- 执行命令（已执行）：\n  - `python scripts/kanban_update.py create JJC-20260305-001 \"中书省转尚书省执行：进入正式流转\" Assigned 尚书省 尚书令 \"门下省已准奏，中书省转尚书省执行\"`\n  - `python scripts/kanban_update.py state JJC-20260305-001 Doing \"尚书省已接令，按皇上要求进入正式流转\"`\n  - `python scripts/kanban_update.py flow JJC-20260305-001 \"中书省\" \"尚书省\" \"已接令并开始执行，进入正式流转\"`\n  - `python scripts/kanban_update.py progress JJC-20260305-001 \"已接令并登记执行进展，进入正式流转\" \"接令登记✅|进展上报✅|形成回执✅|回传中书省🔄\"`\n  - `python scripts/kanban_update.py done JJC-20260305-001 \"outputs/JJC-20260305-001_回执.md\" \"已按皇上要求进入正式流转\"`\n\n**阻塞项**  \n无。","textSignature":"msg_096ae026941704490169a99b3380dc8191afd43b81c18e2034"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":798,"output":550,"cacheRead":16896,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18244,"cost":{"input":0.0013965,"output":0.0077,"cacheRead":0.0029568,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0120533}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1772722991950}}
